{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "IHUI-AI 业务转化漏斗与 API 健康度。漏斗只画有真实事件源的档:register 档(business_funnel_total{stage=\"register\"},封闭枚举带 0 基线,生产埋点 = auth 注册链路 server.recordFunnel('register'),全仓唯一调用点)。【摘档说明】stage=\"activate\" 与 stage=\"paid\" 虽然在 FUNNEL_STAGES 封闭枚举里注册了 0 基线,但生产代码没有任何事件源——users.status 只有 0/1/3 且建号即为 1,全仓无激活/认证/首登列;'首次付费'同样无打点。把它们画成恒零线是把'概念在本产品里不存在'伪装成'发生了 0 次激活/付费',对值班是两种完全不同的结论,故:①'激活用户数'统计板整体移除(无真值,不造假);②'付费用户数'统计板换成'支付成功数',真值改从支付侧真计数器 business_payments_total{channel,status}(status∈attempt|success|refund)与 ihui_payment_success_total{channel} 来(发射手 = order-service 支付路径);③转化率只保留真值可算的 注册→支付成功 一段。本机没发生过支付事件时支付档与转化率为 No data 是事实,禁止用 clamp 或假标签凑 0。",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "返回 AI 总览",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/ihui-ai-overview",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "icon": "external link",
      "tags": ["ihui-ai"]
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "注册用户数",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "business_funnel_total{stage=\"register\"}:封闭枚举三档里唯一有生产调用点的一档(auth 注册链路)。该档有 0 基线,读 0 = 本进程启动窗口内没有新注册,是事实;此档不造假。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(business_funnel_total{stage=\"register\"})",
          "legendFormat": "注册",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "支付成功数",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "顶替原'付费用户数'(funnel stage=\"paid\" 档,已摘除——paid 无事件源,'付费 0 次'不是事实、概念缺席才是)。真值来自支付侧真计数器:A = business_payments_total{status=\"success\"},B = ihui_payment_success_total,发射点在 order-service 支付路径(模块级桥接 recordPaymentSuccess / recordPayment)。本机没支付成功事件时任一序列都不存在 = No data,这是事实,禁止 clamp 成 0 或用假标签凑线。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(business_payments_total{status=\"success\"})",
          "legendFormat": "success(business_payments_total)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(ihui_payment_success_total)",
          "legendFormat": "ihui_payment_success_total",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "转化漏斗（注册→支付成功）",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "description": "两档真值漏斗。原三档里的 activate 已摘除:它查的是 sum(business_funnel_total{stage=\"activate\"}),该档在封闭枚举里带 0 基线但生产无事件源,画出来是一条把'概念不存在'伪装成'0 次激活'的假档;paid 档同理摘除,支付档真值改用 business_payments_total{status=\"success\"}(发射手在 order-service 支付路径)。支付事件未发生时 B 条无序列,不凑 0。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(business_funnel_total{stage=\"register\"})",
          "legendFormat": "注册",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(business_payments_total{status=\"success\"})",
          "legendFormat": "支付成功",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "转化率（注册→支付成功）",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "真值可算的转化率只剩这一段:支付成功 / 注册。原三 target 全部摘除:'注册→激活'与'激活→付费'用了无事件源的 activate 假档,'激活→付费'分母还是假档(除出来是 NaN 冒充有读数);'注册→付费'原式 sum(business_funnel_total{stage=\"paid\"})/… 的 paid 档无事件源,分子改从支付侧真计数器 business_payments_total{status=\"success\"} 来。分母 register 档带 0 基线恒有序列,分子无支付事件时无序列 ⇒ 整板 No data,这是事实,禁止 clamp 凑 0%。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(business_payments_total{status=\"success\"}) / sum(business_funnel_total{stage=\"register\"})",
          "legendFormat": "注册→支付成功",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red"
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.1
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.3
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "API 调用成功率",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(business_api_call_total{status=~\"2..\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(business_api_call_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "成功率",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "API 延迟分位数 (p50/p95/p99)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum(rate(business_api_call_duration_ms_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(business_api_call_duration_ms_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(business_api_call_duration_ms_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "订单量趋势",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
